4,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to stop guessing. Who is actually paying for what?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The silence lately is worse than the noise.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I just need it to be ready when I need it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Let’s look at the data. No more assumptions.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want less stress, honestly.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, what specific data are you thinking of?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I think we need to see the history.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, do you have a specific worry?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, I want the receipts. The real ones.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Asuka, I worry about the time it takes to sort out.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, receipts are good. But what about the fixed costs?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, fixed costs are part of the picture.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, I also care about the condition of the car.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, condition is a result of usage. Let's check usage.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I think we should look at the time spent too.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Okay. Let's pick two things each to investigate.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'll take the history of our conflicts.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I'll check the state of the car and the weekly trips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll look at the fuel receipts and the tax papers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the hours recorded and the mechanic's notes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
